  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Instagram Reel Auto-Reposter\n**How it works:** you share a Reel by DM from your personal account (A) to your channel (B). This workflow checks it came from you, adds your Canva frame, writes an AI caption, and posts it on B.\n\n**Settings live in the `.env` file** on your computer (read by the **Config** node). Change `.env`, then run the setup script again.\n\n**Test mode:** `DRY_RUN=true` in `.env` = nothing is posted.\n\nSee README.md for full instructions."
      },
      "id": "bcb39cad-f6df-4ec5-a4de-17c8c5a09375",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -440,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Part 1 - Meta handshake\nMeta calls this once (GET) when you click **Verify and save** in the Meta app webhook settings."
      },
      "id": "309880c6-d487-40a7-a1be-516ee701e2b0",
      "name": "Note: Verification",
